{"id":"vod_md_3350","vodId":"3350","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"小小克星！","name_cn":"小小克星！","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"26集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230826-1/c232a7c3724fff7df20eee0ff77a91b5.jpg"},"summary":"由于童年的悲惨遭遇，直枝理树（堀江由衣 配音）的个性变得十分孤僻。长着一张娃娃脸，沉默寡言，没有朋友，这样的理树成为了大家眼里的怪胎。某一日，性格傲娇爱猫如命的枣铃（民安智惠 配音），正直开朗稳重可靠的枣恭介（绿川光 配音），四肢发达头脑简单的井之原真人（神奈延年 配音），成熟勇敢剑术一流的宫泽谦吾（织田优成 配音）四人出现在了绝望的理树面前。他们自称“Little Busters”，想要利用理树的力量来完成拯救世界的重任。就这样，理树成为了LB中的一份子，整日奔波解决一些说来宏大但其实十分平凡的委托。在相处的过程中，本来行为举止十分怪异的同伴们渐渐的变得可爱起来，理树也逐渐敞开了紧闭的心门，找回了久违的快乐。他开始明白，只要有一颗开朗向上的心，这样的生活一定能够继续下去直到永远。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-26 08:56:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/4hL1Vq6c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/U2LLWQGE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/SdmzC8az/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/F9r3OyNv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/0CRDJdHA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/6r5W2igL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/InZbuekS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/jqGpomj1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/sPkb6prm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/h6zsoCMO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/Usg5nz4p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/SYQ9EeLI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/QnkX0kn4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/lQCVw511/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https:/